{{Illusionnotes
| name = Arcane Orb
| desc = Neither functional nor is [[toggled]] {{Symbol|Toggle|On}}.
}}
{{Stealnotes
| name = Arcane Orb
| desc = Cannot acquire active {{M|attack modifiers}}.
| structure = hidden
}}
{{Draftnotes
| name = Arcane Orb
| desc = Utilizes the caster's current {{M|attack range}} while {{M|Autocast}} is active, manual cast utilizes the ability's current {{M|cast range}}.
}}

 * For the entire imprison duration, the affected hero has the following properties:
** {{M|Hidden}}
** {{M|Invulnerable}}
** {{M|Unselectable}}
** {{M|Stun}}
** Considers {{M|clones}}, {{M|illusions}} and the {{H|Spirit Bear}} as heroes, other {{M|creep-heroes}} as creeps.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*** {{M|Doubletap}} casts the ability on Harbinger.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
*** {{M|Disable Help}} on Harbinger prevents the ability from imprisoning the allied hero. 
*** {{cf|shdnotes}}
**** Removes the following restrictions applied to allied heroes upon acquiring the {{M|Aghanim's Shard|text=ability upgrade}}:
***** {{M|Hidden}}
***** {{M|Stun}}
**** Applies the following additional ability effects on the affected ally instead for the entire duration:
***** {{M|Attack immune}}.
***** {{M|Disarm}}
***** {{M|Movement speed}} slow.
***** {{M|Mute}}
***** {{M|Phase movement}}.
***** {{M|Silence}}
***** {{M|Untargetable}}

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# Applies the {{Symbol|mp cost}} mana cost.
*# {{A|Outworld Destroyer|Essence Flux}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*# {{Symbol|Mana}}
*#* {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|equilibrium_debuff_counter}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*#** Applies the percentage-based max [[mana]] loss, while retaining the debuff-affected enemy unit's current mana values.
*#** Sets the max mana back to its normal values upon the debuff-affected enemy unit's {{M|death}}.
*#** Upon debuff expiration, only the debuff-affected enemy unit's max mana value is increased, while the current mana value stays unchanged.
*#* {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|obsidian_destroyer_equilibrium_buff}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*#** Grants Harbinger flat bonus max mana per granted buff.
*#** Each stack grants a new buff on the Harbinger, with each stack buff duration independent of the other.
*#** Upon buff expiration, the Harbinger's max mana value is reduced, while the current mana value stays unchanged.
*# The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
*#* {{cf|aghnotes}} Applies the spell damage within radius [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] centered around the debuff-affected enemy unit.
<hr>
* {{cf|shdnotes}} [[File:Dota2 Cast Range to AoE Visualization icon-2-1.png|84px]][[File:Dota2 Cast Range to AoE Visualization icon-2-2.png|84px]]
** Can affect enemy units at max {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Astral Imprisonment cast range}}+{{#var:Astral Imprisonment type4 value1 shd}}}}|shd}} ({{Symbol|bonus t1r}} {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Astral Imprisonment cast range tal}}+{{#var:Astral Imprisonment type4 value1 shd}}}}|shdtal}})-distance away with the [[cast range]] and [[effect radius]].

