| structure = hidden
}}
{{Draftnotes
| name = Arcane Orb
| desc = Utilizes the caster's current {{M|attack range}} while {{M|Autocast}} is active, manual cast utilizes the ability's current {{M|cast range}}.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Attack Modifier}}
** Arcane Orb is an active attack modifier, and has the following properties:
*** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|[[Cast Range|CastRange]] {{=}} Hero[[Attack Range|AtkRange]]}}
*** Affected by {{M|attack range}} sources of the same range-type as the caster.
** Has a different cast range when casting Arcane Orb manually; {{M|Autocast}} uses Harbinger's current {{M|attack range|x}}.
*** Has Autocast off by default.
** {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Instant}}
*** This ability component can be applied by other [[instant attack]] sources.

* Cannot be cast on the following units:
** {{M|Allied units|x}}.
** {{M|Buildings}}
** {{M|Ward-type units}}.

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# Applies the {{Symbol|mp cost}} mana cost.
*# {{A|Outworld Destroyer|Essence Flux}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*# {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}}
*#* Checks the Harbinger's {{M|current mana}} values upon {{M|projectile}} impact.
*#* The {{M|pure}} {{M|spell damage}}.
*# The Harbinger's attack instance.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Arcane Orb icon0}}
| desc = Adds extra pure damage to Outworld Destroyer's attacks, based on his remaining mana pool.
}}
* Upon learning Arcane Orb, it has {{M|Autocast}} off by default.

