fields.value:
 * Casting the ability does not cancel movement orders.

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# Applies the {{Symbol|mp cost}} mana cost.
*# {{A|Outworld Destroyer|Essence Flux}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*# {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}}
*#* Reapplying the buff creates an independent buff instance.

* {{cf|expr}}
** {{M|Damage barrier}}: {{Code|{{#var:Objurgation value1}} + Max[[Mana|MP]] × ({{#var:Objurgation value2}} + {{ValueColor||0.04|agh|x}})}}
<hr>
* {{cf|aghnotes}} The {{M|Aghanim's Scepter|text=ability upgrade}} has two main components:
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]]
*** Has the following proc conditions:
**** {{cf|expr}}
***** {{Code|Current[[Health|HP]] > {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#explode:{{#var:Objurgation type2 value1 agh}}|%}}/100}}|agh|x}} × MaxHP , procs when DamageInstance > Current[[Health|HP]] - ({{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#explode:{{#var:Objurgation type2 value1 agh}}|%}}/100}}|agh|x}} × MaxHP)}}
***** {{Code|Current[[Health|HP]] < {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#explode:{{#var:Objurgation type2 value1 agh}}|%}}/100}}|agh|x}} × MaxHP , procs on any DamageInstance}}
*** The following sources are not considered as valid conditions for the proc:
**** {{M|Setting health}} sources.
**** {{M|Instant kill}} sources.
*** Procs this ability component as long as it fulfills the aforementioned activation conditions, from any damage instance of all [[damage types]], including {{M|HP Removal}} sources.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*** The ability effects are applied as follows upon proc:
***# The {{M|strong dispel}}.
***# Grants a 100% terminal {{M|damage block}} to all {{M|incoming damage|t=p}} instances, causing {{M|on-damage effects}} to not proc, while active.
***#* This is applied as a [[damage manipulation]] factor at the end of the incoming damage calculations.
***# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|obsidian_destroyer_objurgation_cd}}
***#* This ability component acts as the downtime for the passive proc.
***# {{Symbol|bonus db-all}}
***#* Grants self the [[damage barrier]] of its corresponding level.
***#* Has the following properties upon proc:
***#** Works independently of Objurgation's {{M|cooldown}}, and does not cost {{M|mana}}.
***#** Does not proc {{M|on-cast effects}}.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Objurgation icon0}}
| desc = Increases Outworld Destroyer's maximum mana. When cast, protects Outworld Destroyer with an all damage barrier equal to a flat amount and a percentage of his maximum mana.
}}
{{Barriercard}}

